  "description": "This package, CKEditor5.Blazor, is a Blazor wrapper for CKEditor 5, a rich text editor. It allows seamless integration of CKEditor 5 into Blazor applications, providing various editor variants such as Classic, Inline, Balloon, and Document editors. The package includes necessary configurations and JavaScript interop to facilitate the use of CKEditor 5 within Blazor components.",
